---
import '../../../../src/styles/global.css'
import '../../../../src/styles/platform.css'
---
<body class="bg-[url(/../..//bg.png)] bg-fixed bg-center bg-no-repeat bg-cover ">

    <body class="bg-[url(/../..//bg.png)] bg-fixed bg-center bg-no-repeat bg-cover ">
        <!--navbar -->
            <div class=" left-0 top-0 fixed">
                <img src="/../../navbar_.png" class="h-screen">
                <img src="/../../stick.png" class="h-screen absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-[9] ">
                <div class="z-10 absolute top-0 left-0 right-0">
                    <a href="/documentation/game">
                    <img src="/../../game.png" class="min-w-full lift">
                </a>
                    <a href="/documentation/trailer">
                    <img src="/../../trailer.png" class="min-w-full lift">
                    </a>
                    <a href="/documentation/shipping">
                        <img src="/../../shipping.png" class="min-w-full lift">
                        </a>
                    <a href="/documentation/submit">
                            <img src="/../../submit.png" class="min-w-full lift">
                        </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        
<div class="ml-[58.9vh] p-20 text-center max-w-full">
<h1>submitting!</h1>

<div class="bg-[#fb4bb0] rounded-xl p-5 mt-10">
    <h2>Contents</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="#Checklist">Checklist for Submission</a></li>
        <li><a href="#Ready">Ready to Submit?</a></li>
    </ul>
    </div>

<div class="bg-[#fb4bb0] rounded-xl p-5 mt-10" id="Checklist">
    <h2>Checklist for Submission</h2>
        <p>A list of things you'll need!</p>
        <ul>
            <li>- publicised game demo, trailer demo, and repository</li>
            <li>- frequent commits in your repository</li>
            <li>- art/trailer hours tracked with either lapse or the journaling template</li>
            <li>- a good readme</li>
            <li>- post made about your game on social media (reddit,tumblr, etc)</li>
            <li>(more coming soon!)</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

<div class="bg-[#fb4bb0] rounded-xl p-5 mt-10" id="Ready">
    <h2>Ready to Submit?</h2>
    <p class="mt-4">If you're ready to submit, then head to <a href="https://submit.hackclub.com/premiere">https://submit.hackclub.com/premiere</a> to submit your project.</p>
</div>

</div>
</body>
